## 🔑 Key Features of the System

1. International Transfer Comparison – Compare international transfer fees, exchange rates, and delivery times.

2. Tuition Payment Management – Manage tuition fees, payment schedules, and deadlines.

3. Credit-Building Assistance – Provide country-specific credit history guidance and responsible borrowing tips.

4. Multi-Currency Management – Convert currencies and track balances, income, and expenses across multiple currencies.

5. AI Financial Assistant – Provide personalized financial guidance for international students and cross-border users.

6. Budgeting and Notifications – Track expenses, set savings goals, and receive payment reminders.

7. AI Tuition & Cash-Shortfall Predictor– Predict potential funding gaps based on savings, income, expenses, and upcoming tuition payments.

8. Tuition Payment Verification – Verify payment instructions against trusted university information and flag discrepancies.

9. Financial Scam & Fraud Alerts– Identify suspicious payment requests and potential fraud indicators.

10. Live Financial-Provider Integrations – Connect with authorized financial service providers to access available exchange rates, transfer quotes, and transaction statuses.

11. Financial Insights & Analytics Dashboard – Display spending patterns, transfer costs, savings progress, and upcoming financial commitments.


